WEBVTT

00:00.890 --> 00:05.600
<b>Edo Castle Oniwaban Group,
secret agent Han'nya.</b>

00:05.940 --> 00:09.020
<b>By orders of our leader,
I will guard this location with my life.</b>

00:10.070 --> 00:13.070
<b>I'd like to avoid unnecessary battle
if I can, that I would.</b>

00:13.490 --> 00:15.160
<b>Can you possibly step aside from there?</b>

00:15.490 --> 00:17.990
<b>Our leader's orders are absolute.</b>

00:21.200 --> 00:25.170
<b>Damn guy is wearing iron gauntlets
under his leather gloves.</b>

00:25.750 --> 00:30.800
<b>So that's how he so easily parried
Kenshin's attack the other day.</b>

00:32.630 --> 00:35.550
<b>Looks like we have to fight here,
that we do.</b>

00:36.430 --> 00:38.720
<b>I'm sorry, but I cannot hold back.</b>

00:38.720 --> 00:41.560
<b>I can say the same thing.</b>

00:42.560 --> 00:43.480
<b>Here goes.</b>

02:13.980 --> 02:17.990
<b>EPISODE 11:
SAVAGE HAN'NYA -
HONORABLE SHIKIJO</b>

02:32.080 --> 02:32.960
<b>A direct hit?</b>

02:34.590 --> 02:36.050
<b><i>Backhand!</i></b>

02:46.600 --> 02:48.560
<b>Why are you getting all beat up?</b>

02:48.810 --> 02:50.190
<b>That's so not like you!</b>

02:50.190 --> 02:53.900
<b>Hurry up and use that signature
"reading" of Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu!</b>

02:53.900 --> 02:55.770
<b>I already am using it, that I am.</b>

02:56.820 --> 02:58.990
<b>I read his punch and his backhand.</b>

02:59.280 --> 03:01.450
<b>I dodged it with little room to spare.</b>

03:01.860 --> 03:05.490
<b>However, right before my eyes,
his arm grew longer for an instant.</b>

03:06.290 --> 03:08.410
<b>What's wrong, Battosai?</b>

03:08.410 --> 03:11.250
<b>Your true strength
should be nothing like this.</b>

03:11.540 --> 03:14.290
<b>If you can't even defeat my spell,</b>

03:14.290 --> 03:17.590
<b>you won't last one minute
fighting our leader.</b>

03:17.840 --> 03:18.670
<b>Spell?</b>

03:19.380 --> 03:24.760
<b>You had already fallen under my spell
one week ago,</b>

03:24.760 --> 03:27.640
<b>in the moment when you
saw me in this guise,</b>

03:27.810 --> 03:30.180
<b>and you never realized it.</b>

03:35.730 --> 03:36.940
<b>Looks like it has started.</b>

03:37.980 --> 03:39.150
<b>Han'nya is formidable.</b>

03:39.740 --> 03:42.820
<b>Not only is he
an excellent master of kenpo,</b>

03:42.820 --> 03:45.450
<b>he uses the deadly Shinwan Spell.</b>

03:46.030 --> 03:48.620
<b>Unless you can see through
what the spell is about,</b>

03:48.620 --> 03:50.120
<b>you won't have a chance at victory.</b>

03:50.870 --> 03:52.120
<b>I get it now.</b>

03:52.120 --> 03:54.000
<b>A spell... that it is.</b>

03:54.540 --> 03:58.800
<b>As troublesome as it is,
I first need to break that spell.</b>

04:03.180 --> 04:05.640
<b>Hey, what's with that stance?</b>

04:05.640 --> 04:06.930
<b>No clue.</b>

04:07.600 --> 04:11.020
<b>It's closest to Seigan
among the five basic stances,</b>

04:11.020 --> 04:12.480
<b>but it's clearly different.</b>

04:13.480 --> 04:15.560
<b>This is the Shinken stance!</b>

04:16.150 --> 04:18.480
<b>Extending both arms
from the Seigan stance,</b>

04:18.480 --> 04:22.280
<b>you hold the blade parallel
and between your opponent's eyebrows.</b>

04:22.570 --> 04:26.070
<b>A solid defense stance
seen in ancient sword arts,</b>

04:26.070 --> 04:29.790
<b>able to immediately react
to any change in your opponent!</b>

04:30.240 --> 04:32.040
<b>However, on the flip side,</b>

04:32.040 --> 04:36.710
<b>it is a defense-only stance
that is hard to turn offensive!</b>

04:36.710 --> 04:40.090
<b>Are you hiding behind this, Battosai?</b>

04:41.800 --> 04:42.880
<b>Answer me!</b>

04:45.800 --> 04:48.800
<b>This, a man like this,</b>

04:48.800 --> 04:50.970
<b>is the true identity
of the legendary Hitokiri!</b>

04:51.970 --> 04:55.190
<b>It seems I have been foolish
to overestimate you!</b>

04:55.770 --> 05:00.980
<b>Someone like you has no qualification
to fight our leader, Lord Aoshi!</b>

05:01.440 --> 05:03.240
<b>I will slaughter you right here!</b>

05:03.780 --> 05:07.700
<b>No matter how solid of a defense
the Shinken stance is,</b>

05:07.700 --> 05:10.030
<b>unless you can see through
what my Shinwan is about,</b>

05:10.030 --> 05:11.620
<b>it is impossible for you to dodge it!</b>

05:17.420 --> 05:18.250
<b>He dodged it!</b>

05:18.250 --> 05:19.080
<b>He saw through it?</b>

05:22.880 --> 05:23.800
<b>He did it!</b>

05:23.800 --> 05:25.760
<b>You saw through it, Kenshin?</b>

05:26.050 --> 05:28.800
<b>Yeah. The truth behind the spell</b>

05:28.800 --> 05:33.020
<b>was the horizontal stripe tattoos
on both his arms.</b>

05:33.350 --> 05:34.560
<b>Horizontal stripes.</b>

05:35.600 --> 05:36.430
<b>I see!</b>

05:36.430 --> 05:37.810
<b>An optical illusion!</b>

05:38.310 --> 05:42.190
<b>Horizontal stripes make things look
thicker and shorter than actual size.</b>

05:42.690 --> 05:45.950
<b>And that was throwing
your visual estimation off!</b>

05:46.150 --> 05:49.660
<b>His arm was more than an inch
longer than my estimate.</b>

05:50.280 --> 05:53.410
<b>And that difference made it feel
like his arm was extending,</b>

05:53.620 --> 05:57.290
<b>making the blow hit
when I thought I'd evade it, that it did.</b>

05:57.540 --> 05:59.580
<b>I see, so you...</b>

06:00.080 --> 06:06.380
<b>used the blade's edge during that
Shinken stance to measure the difference!</b>

06:06.920 --> 06:08.680
<b>I get it.</b>

06:08.680 --> 06:12.220
<b>A swordsman is fully aware
of the length of his cherished sword.</b>

06:12.220 --> 06:14.890
<b>That means it's a perfect candidate
to be a yardstick!</b>

06:15.140 --> 06:20.600
<b>When I first saw you, I was dubious
about that strange shinobi garment.</b>

06:20.600 --> 06:23.360
<b>Especially the stripes on both arms
that make you stand out so much</b>

06:23.360 --> 06:26.240
<b>that you are at a disadvantage
as an onmitsu.</b>

06:26.240 --> 06:30.110
<b>However, it served as an advantage
as a kenpo master.</b>

06:30.110 --> 06:33.280
<b>Furthermore, you use that han'nya mask
to hide your gaze and expression,</b>

06:33.280 --> 06:35.830
<b>making it harder to judge
where your attack will come from.</b>

06:36.620 --> 06:39.000
<b>There is that.</b>

06:39.000 --> 06:43.040
<b>However, there is a bigger reason
for this han'nya mask.</b>

06:43.340 --> 06:47.090
<b>It is to hide my actual face itself.</b>

06:58.270 --> 06:59.520
<b>A monster.</b>

07:00.140 --> 07:01.940
<b>A monster, huh?</b>

07:02.900 --> 07:07.400
<b>That said, this face proves useful,
so I do like it.</b>

07:07.400 --> 07:08.240
<b>You...</b>

07:08.990 --> 07:10.700
<b>Did you do that to your face...</b>

07:11.240 --> 07:14.030
<b>I am a spy.</b>

07:14.030 --> 07:16.910
<b>My main mission
is gathering intelligence.</b>

07:17.830 --> 07:22.920
<b>In order to be able to disguise myself
with any face, I burned off my lips,</b>

07:23.250 --> 07:27.510
<b>chopped my ears and nose off,
and crushed my cheekbones.</b>

07:28.760 --> 07:31.340
<b>I don't know where all of you were born,</b>

07:31.840 --> 07:35.800
<b>but the area I was born
has many poor villages.</b>

07:36.310 --> 07:40.270
<b>In villages like that, even to this day,
there is a secret tradition</b>

07:40.270 --> 07:43.560
<b>where parents kill children
to lessen food expenses.</b>

07:43.850 --> 07:47.400
<b>They called it "returning the children"
in my village.</b>

07:47.610 --> 07:49.490
<b>You can't be...</b>

07:50.070 --> 07:54.530
<b>Even if you barely escape death,
you can't stay in your house anymore.</b>

07:55.030 --> 07:58.450
<b>From there,
you have to roam like dogs and cats</b>

07:58.450 --> 08:02.160
<b>and follow a path of savagery where you
kill and plunder like a lone wolf.</b>

08:03.580 --> 08:04.420
<b>However...</b>

08:05.330 --> 08:06.170
<b>Claws!</b>

08:06.380 --> 08:10.920
<b>...Lord Aoshi took me in,
even in my lone-wolf state,</b>

08:10.920 --> 08:14.130
<b>and raised me
into a top-ranked onmitsu!</b>

08:14.130 --> 08:17.430
<b>And he gave me
the Edo Castle Oniwaban Group,</b>

08:17.430 --> 08:20.720
<b>a reason to live and a group of comrades!</b>

08:21.060 --> 08:26.690
<b>If I can be of help to Lord Aoshi,
I don't need my face nor my life!</b>

08:26.900 --> 08:28.150
<b>Be careful, Kenshin!</b>

08:28.150 --> 08:29.020
<b>This guy is nuts!</b>

08:29.570 --> 08:30.900
<b>This guy is a fanatic monster</b>

08:30.900 --> 08:35.110
<b>who risks everything for his leader
and the Oniwaban Group!</b>

08:37.280 --> 08:39.330
<b>Han'nya, answer one question.</b>

08:39.740 --> 08:43.080
<b>Do you know the past of Miss Megumi,
that you do?</b>

08:43.080 --> 08:44.460
<b>Don't underestimate me!</b>

08:44.460 --> 08:49.300
<b>There is not one thing the Oniwaban spies
don't know about, none!</b>

09:08.520 --> 09:09.940
<b>No good.</b>

09:10.360 --> 09:14.530
<b>With that skill, you can't hold a candle
against Lord Aoshi...</b>

09:15.200 --> 09:17.160
<b>at... all.</b>

09:22.490 --> 09:24.120
<b>He finally fell.</b>

09:24.620 --> 09:26.460
<b>That was a formidable opponent.</b>

09:27.830 --> 09:28.830
<b>Han'nya...</b>

09:29.750 --> 09:33.630
<b>you should know the hardships of solitude
more than anyone else.</b>

09:34.340 --> 09:37.550
<b>But why couldn't you be considerate
to Miss Megumi as well?</b>

09:39.800 --> 09:40.800
<b>Kenshin.</b>

09:42.180 --> 09:44.060
<b>I'm worried about Miss Megumi, that I am.</b>

09:44.560 --> 09:45.520
<b>Let's hurry onward.</b>

09:55.280 --> 09:56.150
<b>Megumi!</b>

09:56.450 --> 09:57.700
<b>Are you listening?</b>

09:58.610 --> 09:59.490
<b>Megumi!</b>

09:59.700 --> 10:01.370
<b>Shut up.</b>

10:01.370 --> 10:03.790
<b>You can unlock the door
and hurry on in here.</b>

10:03.790 --> 10:06.120
<b>Aoshi has taken the key!</b>

10:06.620 --> 10:08.710
<b>What do you want now?</b>

10:08.870 --> 10:11.500
<b>I am sorry. My bad. I apologize!</b>

10:12.000 --> 10:14.050
<b>I'll do something about the room key!</b>

10:14.050 --> 10:16.300
<b>So let's get away from here together!</b>

10:16.630 --> 10:19.050
<b>If we use the secret passageway,
they won't catch on!</b>

10:19.550 --> 10:20.970
<b>You're kidding me.</b>

10:20.970 --> 10:23.140
<b>What good does it do me
to run away with you?</b>

10:23.140 --> 10:25.220
<b>We can do anything!</b>

10:25.220 --> 10:28.440
<b>Your knowledge and technology,
paired with my business skills,</b>

10:28.440 --> 10:31.020
<b>can develop any new drugs we wish!</b>

10:31.020 --> 10:33.570
<b>We can save people
who are suffering from illnesses!</b>

10:34.610 --> 10:37.490
<b>I reflect on—
no, repent, my past activities,</b>

10:37.820 --> 10:40.820
<b>how I treated you, and the crimes
I committed against society!</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.580
<b>I want to do it over if I can,</b>

10:43.580 --> 10:46.250
<b>together with you,
who bear the same sins as I do!</b>

10:50.670 --> 10:52.840
<b>Go somewhere else, Kanryu.</b>

10:52.840 --> 10:54.840
<b>I'm sick of your lies.</b>

10:54.840 --> 10:55.670
<b>Wha—</b>

10:56.090 --> 10:58.340
<b>There is no way
we can atone for these sins.</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:03.180
<b>The only thing I can do now is to prevent
any further damage from opium.</b>

11:03.850 --> 11:04.890
<b>That's all.</b>

11:06.100 --> 11:08.520
<b>I'll see you in hell, Kanryu.</b>

11:09.350 --> 11:13.360
<b>G-G-G-Give me a break!</b>

11:13.360 --> 11:15.480
<b>The one at fault is none other than you!</b>

11:15.690 --> 11:18.280
<b>It's your fault for making the opium!</b>

11:18.280 --> 11:21.070
<b>It's your fault for not making the opium!</b>

11:21.530 --> 11:23.280
<b>Don't drag me into this!</b>

11:23.280 --> 11:26.410
<b>You wench, bratty girl,
evil woman, wicked woman,</b>

11:26.410 --> 11:28.000
<b>son of a bitch!</b>

11:28.000 --> 11:29.250
<b>I've had enough!</b>

11:29.250 --> 11:31.670
<b>You can intoxicate yourself
with your heroism in there!</b>

11:31.670 --> 11:35.420
<b>What would all my customers
who died because of you think?</b>

11:41.510 --> 11:42.760
<b><i>Scum...</i></b>

11:43.970 --> 11:46.970
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

11:48.390 --> 11:49.980
<b>How are your wounds?</b>

11:50.230 --> 11:51.770
<b>They're shallow, that they are.</b>

11:51.770 --> 11:53.400
<b>The bleeding has stopped already.</b>

11:58.070 --> 11:59.070
<b><i>But...</i></b>

11:59.360 --> 12:01.150
<b><i>what kind of guy is this Aoshi Shinomori</i></b>

12:01.150 --> 12:06.450
<b><i>if someone of Han'nya's stature
can be so devoted?</i></b>

12:11.330 --> 12:15.330
<b>The fact that you came here
means Han'nya has been defeated, eh?</b>

12:15.580 --> 12:17.420
<b>You're quite good.</b>

12:17.880 --> 12:22.260
<b>Edo Castle Oniwaban Group,
main keep guard Shikijo.</b>

12:22.260 --> 12:25.260
<b>One more, in lieu of a greeting!</b>

12:27.180 --> 12:28.180
<b>Sano!</b>

12:28.390 --> 12:32.560
<b>Leave this muscle-head to me,
and you should hurry on ahead.</b>

12:32.940 --> 12:35.980
<b>I can easily take care of a guy like him.</b>

12:35.980 --> 12:38.650
<b>So you hurry up
and go drag out that twisted woman!</b>

12:39.070 --> 12:40.150
<b>Sano.</b>

12:41.610 --> 12:42.860
<b>Yahiko, let's go!</b>

12:42.860 --> 12:43.820
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:50.700 --> 12:51.660
<b>Damn you.</b>

12:51.830 --> 12:54.620
<b>You fully intended
on letting Kenshin go, didn't you?</b>

12:54.870 --> 13:00.500
<b>Well, yeah. Giving the best part to
the leader is how one plays by the book.</b>

13:01.010 --> 13:03.590
<b>I'll have to settle for the underling...</b>

13:03.590 --> 13:05.180
<b>Zanza, fighter for hire.</b>

13:07.010 --> 13:11.060
<b>Surprised? Han'nya went ahead
and did extra research.</b>

13:11.560 --> 13:15.640
<b>So I hear you were quite famous
in the underground society.</b>

13:15.900 --> 13:20.980
<b>Of course, you're a nobody
now that you don't have the Zanbato.</b>

13:21.780 --> 13:24.280
<b>Don't you be misunderstanding,
damn it!</b>

13:24.570 --> 13:26.030
<b>I don't got my Zanbato,</b>

13:26.030 --> 13:30.120
<b>but my two arms that controlled it at will
are still around!</b>

13:30.450 --> 13:33.910
<b>I'm the one
that's settling for the underling!</b>

13:36.370 --> 13:39.880
<b>Hey, Kenshin, is Sanosuke
all right by himself?</b>

13:39.880 --> 13:42.130
<b>That guy looked pretty tough.</b>

13:42.130 --> 13:44.840
<b>We're talking about Sano,
so he'll be all right, that he will.</b>

13:44.840 --> 13:46.630
<b>In the first place, even if we were there,</b>

13:46.630 --> 13:48.590
<b>he wouldn't let us help out,
that he wouldn't.</b>

13:49.350 --> 13:50.300
<b>We're going in.</b>

13:50.930 --> 13:52.310
<b>Brace yourself!</b>

13:56.230 --> 13:58.560
<b>I have even been
the guard for the main keep,</b>

13:58.560 --> 14:01.730
<b>and you call me an underling? How amusing.</b>

14:02.270 --> 14:06.110
<b>How about we both use only
our two arms that we're so proud of</b>

14:06.110 --> 14:08.910
<b>and literally try our hands at it?</b>

14:08.910 --> 14:10.030
<b>Bring it on!</b>

14:13.240 --> 14:14.080
<b>Damn you!</b>

14:14.370 --> 14:16.330
<b>Wasn't this gonna be a barehanded fight?</b>

14:16.330 --> 14:17.460
<b>No need to fret.</b>

14:21.340 --> 14:23.420
<b>This is how you use it.</b>

14:26.380 --> 14:27.300
<b>Whoa!</b>

14:30.680 --> 14:34.100
<b>Now... we shall determine
which of us is the underling.</b>

14:39.560 --> 14:41.060
<b>That ends it.</b>

14:41.810 --> 14:43.860
<b>You seemed to have some spirit in you...</b>

14:43.860 --> 14:46.690
<b>but, well, you came across the wrong guy.</b>

14:48.240 --> 14:49.280
<b>Don't you go...</b>

14:50.990 --> 14:54.160
<b>Don't you go thinking
you've already won.</b>

14:54.660 --> 14:57.330
<b>You sure fight a weird-ass fight.</b>

14:57.830 --> 14:59.870
<b>What was that
about trying our hands at it?</b>

14:59.870 --> 15:01.250
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

15:01.710 --> 15:05.880
<b>A man's gotta fight
with nothing up his sleeve!</b>

15:06.510 --> 15:10.010
<b>Don't you be playing around
with toys like this!</b>

15:11.180 --> 15:13.550
<b>Man, I feel lighter.</b>

15:13.550 --> 15:15.680
<b>I feel like I can really get it on now.</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:16.890
<b>Wonderful!</b>

15:17.560 --> 15:20.980
<b>Those retorts! Wonderful, just wonderful!</b>

15:20.980 --> 15:24.270
<b>Indeed, you don't seem
like your average underling.</b>

15:24.520 --> 15:26.980
<b>Who ya callin' an underling, ya putz?</b>

15:31.950 --> 15:33.950
<b>Wonderful. How wonderful!</b>

15:33.950 --> 15:34.780
<b>But...</b>

15:40.920 --> 15:43.000
<b>Oh... sorry, sorry.</b>

15:43.330 --> 15:45.590
<b>I couldn't help but headbutt there.</b>

15:46.090 --> 15:48.840
<b>As you can tell
from scars all over my body,</b>

15:48.840 --> 15:51.970
<b>my whole life is about fighting.</b>

15:52.470 --> 15:56.060
<b>My body moves before I can even think.</b>

15:57.010 --> 15:58.180
<b>Damn you!</b>

15:58.720 --> 16:00.520
<b>Stop it.</b>

16:00.520 --> 16:01.810
<b>It's quite something</b>

16:01.810 --> 16:04.480
<b>that your skull didn't shatter
from my headbutt,</b>

16:04.480 --> 16:06.480
<b>but what's inside is a different matter.</b>

16:07.020 --> 16:09.530
<b>From the shock your brain felt there,</b>

16:09.530 --> 16:12.740
<b>you shouldn't be able to move
even one finger for a while.</b>

16:13.360 --> 16:14.200
<b>That said...</b>

16:14.820 --> 16:17.580
<b>you made my hand tingle.</b>

16:18.410 --> 16:20.120
<b>I like you, boy.</b>

16:20.120 --> 16:21.120
<b>So how about it?</b>

16:21.250 --> 16:25.830
<b>Why don't you cut ties with that Battosai
and come be one of us?</b>

16:25.830 --> 16:26.710
<b>Huh?</b>

16:26.920 --> 16:29.630
<b>We don't care about family backgrounds.</b>

16:30.130 --> 16:32.550
<b>If you're strong, you pass.</b>

16:32.550 --> 16:37.560
<b>Even I originally was an onmitsu
for the Satsuma Domain.</b>

16:37.560 --> 16:41.430
<b>Which means
I was on the Imperialist side.</b>

16:42.060 --> 16:45.940
<b>In 1866, I was given orders
to investigate Edo Castle</b>

16:45.940 --> 16:48.820
<b>to prepare for the upcoming battle.</b>

16:49.230 --> 16:52.700
<b>But I was defeated by our leader,
who was only 13 years old at the time.</b>

16:53.320 --> 16:55.700
<b><i>Your muscles are extraordinary.</i></b>

16:56.370 --> 16:58.490
<b><i>It would be a shame
to kill off such a spy.</i></b>

16:58.660 --> 17:00.700
<b><i>If you use the elixir
of muscular amplification</i></b>

17:00.700 --> 17:04.620
<b><i>passed down among the Oniwaban Group,
you will become even stronger.</i></b>

17:04.870 --> 17:06.540
<b><i>You should join our ranks.</i></b>

17:07.000 --> 17:09.840
<b><i>If you do, you can become invincible.</i></b>

17:10.800 --> 17:11.960
<b><i>Invincible?</i></b>

17:13.630 --> 17:18.010
<b>And so, I gained
this invincible muscular strength!</b>

17:18.350 --> 17:19.810
<b>The same goes for you.</b>

17:19.810 --> 17:22.770
<b>You have the potential
to become infinitely stronger.</b>

17:23.270 --> 17:28.480
<b>If you use the Oniwaban Group elixir,
you might even surpass Han'nya and myself!</b>

17:30.020 --> 17:32.990
<b>If you ain't exaggeratin',</b>

17:32.990 --> 17:36.320
<b>this Aoshi Shinomori
is quite a powerful guy.</b>

17:36.570 --> 17:41.410
<b>Yes! If our leader had been in Kyoto
to defeat the Imperialists,</b>

17:41.410 --> 17:44.830
<b>the legend of the most powerful wouldn't
have been about someone like Battosai.</b>

17:44.830 --> 17:47.790
<b>It would have been that of our leader!</b>

17:47.790 --> 17:50.500
<b>The Oniwaban Group is powerful.</b>

17:50.500 --> 17:54.220
<b>You guys to begin with,
but Beshimi and Hyottoko, too.</b>

17:54.220 --> 17:57.300
<b>Depending on how they fight,
they're nothin' to sneeze at.</b>

17:57.300 --> 17:58.550
<b>But...</b>

17:59.140 --> 18:01.010
<b>that's as far as it goes.</b>

18:01.430 --> 18:03.640
<b>It seems like powerful guys</b>

18:03.640 --> 18:06.770
<b>gather for one reason or another
around Aoshi Shinomori.</b>

18:06.770 --> 18:08.600
<b>But that's all.</b>

18:08.600 --> 18:11.020
<b>What do you want to say?</b>

18:11.400 --> 18:15.320
<b>Each and every one of you is just strong.</b>

18:15.320 --> 18:21.080
<b>That's why gathering powerful individuals
and fighting becomes everything for you.</b>

18:21.080 --> 18:23.790
<b>But Kenshin Himura is different.</b>

18:23.790 --> 18:27.920
<b>Missie, Yahiko, and Megumi Takani...</b>

18:28.080 --> 18:30.960
<b>all sorts of people admire him
and create a ring.</b>

18:31.460 --> 18:35.010
<b>Hitokiri is a name of the past,
and now he's a rurouni,</b>

18:35.010 --> 18:38.880
<b>but fighting
still always happens around him.</b>

18:39.390 --> 18:40.800
<b>Even then...</b>

18:41.100 --> 18:44.060
<b>What do you wanna say, little boy?</b>

18:46.520 --> 18:49.060
<b>Everyone gets it.</b>

18:49.060 --> 18:51.060
<b>No matter how strong,</b>

18:51.060 --> 18:54.610
<b>Kenshin will never wield his sword
for his own battles.</b>

18:54.780 --> 18:55.610
<b>Damn it—</b>

18:56.900 --> 19:01.660
<b>His sakabato always exists
only to protect other people!</b>

19:01.990 --> 19:04.080
<b>The Oniwaban Group
has drowned in their strength</b>

19:04.080 --> 19:07.120
<b>and has been reduced
to pawns for Kanryu Takeda.</b>

19:07.410 --> 19:10.330
<b>Kenshin Himura is
of a completely different caliber!</b>

19:10.330 --> 19:12.630
<b>Damn it!</b>

19:12.840 --> 19:17.720
<b>I gave a small compliment,
and you let it go to your head, you scum!</b>

19:17.970 --> 19:21.180
<b>Who is drowning
in their own strength, huh?</b>

19:22.640 --> 19:26.720
<b>Here I am being nice to you,
and you get all stuck-up!</b>

19:27.220 --> 19:33.310
<b>You can talk big
after you defeat Lord Shikijo here!</b>

19:33.310 --> 19:35.230
<b>And acting like that...</b>

19:35.440 --> 19:40.150
<b>is what I'm calling
"drowning in your strength," you moron!</b>

19:40.150 --> 19:41.860
<b>What the...</b>

19:45.990 --> 19:48.370
<b>This is the end, underling.</b>

19:54.920 --> 19:57.380
<b>No matter how hard your skull may be,</b>

19:57.380 --> 20:01.050
<b>"what's inside is a different matter,"
was it?</b>

20:04.090 --> 20:10.100
<b>Shikijo, if you ever get the opportunity,
you should fight against Kenshin sometime.</b>

20:10.640 --> 20:15.810
<b>Maybe you'll be able to regain
something important that you've lost.</b>

20:20.490 --> 20:26.660
<b>But anyway, just how many more
of these Oniwaban Group are there?</b>

20:26.660 --> 20:28.370
<b>If stuff like this continues...</b>

20:28.870 --> 20:31.250
<b>my body won't last...</b>

20:35.750 --> 20:41.300
<b>We know each other's faces, but this
is the first time we speak, that is...</b>

20:42.010 --> 20:42.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:43.260 --> 20:46.550
<b>I would like to avoid
unnecessary battle, that I would.</b>

20:47.260 --> 20:51.770
<b>Can you step aside and let me know
where Kanryu and Miss Megumi are?</b>

20:52.350 --> 20:55.100
<b>Did Han'nya step aside
when he was told that?</b>

20:56.190 --> 20:57.520
<b>Of course he didn't.</b>

21:00.400 --> 21:04.070
<b>You need to ask me the whereabouts
of those two with that sakabato.</b>

21:05.570 --> 21:08.490
<b>I will answer... with this.</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.970
<b>NEXT EPISODE
OKASHIRA -
AOSHI SHINOMORI</b>

22:46.170 --> 22:49.390
<b><i>Next episode,
"Okashira - Aoshi Shinomori."</i></b>
